        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that having multiple locations capable of manufacturing for our core products would help mitigate the potential impact of a production disruption at any one of our facilities and/or any major changes in the macro trade environment to ensure a reliable, resilient and stable supply chain and product availability for our customers.",
